msgid "Top 15 Visited Websites Traffic"
msgstr "网站访问流量 Top 15"

msgid "SSH Login Audit (Incremental)"
msgstr "SSH 登录审计 (增量)"

msgid "banIP Security Audit (Auto-skipped if not installed)"
msgstr "banIP 联动处决报告 (若未安装则自动跳过)"

